    "# Adaptive MVDR Beamforming: Mathematical Intuition and Implementation\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook provides a comprehensive understanding of adaptive MVDR (Minimum Variance Distortionless Response) beamforming with:\n",
    "- Mathematical foundations with step-by-step derivations\n",
    "- Visual intuition through extensive plots and animations\n",
    "- Detailed explanations of steering vectors, covariance matrices, and weight calculation\n",
    "- Practical implementation with 2-microphone arrays\n",
    "- Optimization problem visualization\n",
    "\n",
    "**Topics Covered:**\n",
    "1. Why adaptive beamforming?\n",
    "2. Steering vector (mathematical and geometric intuition)\n",
    "3. Covariance matrix R (noise statistics)\n",
    "4. MVDR optimization problem\n",
    "5. Weight calculation and adaptation\n",
    "6. Adaptive nulling and noise reduction\n",
    "7. Beam pattern visualization\n",
    "8. Practical 2-mic array examples\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
