    "---\n",
    "## 4. MVDR Optimization Problem\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.1 Mathematical Formulation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Goal**: Find weights $\\mathbf{w}$ that minimize output power while preserving target signal.\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\min_{\\mathbf{w}} \\quad \\mathbf{w}^H \\mathbf{R} \\mathbf{w}$$\n",
    "$$\\text{subject to} \\quad \\mathbf{w}^H \\mathbf{a} = 1$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Intuition:**\n",
    "- **Objective**: $\\mathbf{w}^H \\mathbf{R} \\mathbf{w}$ = output power\n",
    "  - Minimize this → suppress noise\n",
    "- **Constraint**: $\\mathbf{w}^H \\mathbf{a} = 1$\n",
    "  - Ensure signal from direction $\\theta$ is preserved (gain = 1)\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.2 Solution (using Lagrange Multipliers)\n",
    "\n",
    "The optimal weights are:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\mathbf{w}_{\\text{MVDR}} = \\frac{\\mathbf{R}^{-1} \\mathbf{a}}{\\mathbf{a}^H \\mathbf{R}^{-1} \\mathbf{a}}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Step-by-step:**\n",
    "1. Compute $\\mathbf{R}^{-1}$ (inverse of covariance matrix)\n",
    "2. Multiply: $\\mathbf{R}^{-1} \\mathbf{a}$ (\"whitened\" steering vector)\n",
    "3. Normalize: divide by $\\mathbf{a}^H \\mathbf{R}^{-1} \\mathbf{a}$ (ensures constraint)\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
